What is the difference between NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib and Scikit-learn?"

NumPy is used for numerical computing and multidimensional arrays. 

Pandas is used for data manipulation and analysis using DataFrames and Series. 

Matplotlib is used for data visualization and creating charts and graphs. 

Scikit-learn is a Machine Learning library used for preprocessing, model training, prediction, and model evaluation

=====

They are not competing libraries. They complement each other and are commonly used together in a Data Science / Machine Learning project.

